                                                "text": "1885, L. and A. Maude (translators), Leo Tolstoy, \"What Men Live By\", in What Men Live By and Other Tales\nHe put on over his shirt his wife's wadded nankeen jacket, and over that he put his own cloth coat."
                                            },
